      "threadId": "PRRT_kwDORKRjBc6eDDdp",
      "replyToCommentDatabaseId": 3902738893,
      "path": "VAA.EAPI.GraphQL/VAA.EAPI.GraphQL.Domain.Account/Mutations/CreateUnder18AccountMutation.cs",
      "line": 43,
      "url": "https://github.com/VAAD1ST/eapi/pull/1731#discussion_r3902738893",
      "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
      "body": "`DateOnly.TryParse` is culture-sensitive; if the function host is running under a non-ISO culture, a valid ISO-8601 `yyyy-MM-dd` value can fail to parse and incorrectly reject the request. Use `DateOnly.TryParseExact` with the expected format and `InvariantCulture` to make the DOB validation deterministic (see the existing `DateOnlyJsonConverter` pattern in `VAA.EAPI.GraphQL.Domain.Holidays`).",
      "decision": "valid",
      "resolutionComment": "Updated CreateUnder18AccountMutation to parse the documented yyyy-MM-dd DOB contract with DateOnly.TryParseExact, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, and DateTimeStyles.None. Added a regression test confirming non-ISO date input is rejected."
    }
  ],
